  "description": "Experience Hello Neighbor - available for free download and quick installation. Completely secure, free from viruses or malware. Always have easy access to the most recent version.",
  "editor_review": "Step into the world of Hello Neighbor, an exhilarating stealth horror game that promises to keep you engaged! Get ready to sneak into the home of your neighbor and reveal the terrifying mysteries hidden in his basement. But be cautious, your neighbor isn't just any adversary. He possesses a sophisticated AI that adapts to your every action, intensifying each confrontation. Whether you choose to sneak in through a window or the front door, be prepared for traps and surveillance that will challenge your progress. Will you be able to outsmart the Neighbor and break free from his grasp? Discover the answer in Hello Neighbor!",
  "how_to_play": [
    "Infiltrate your neighbor's home without being detected",
    "Watch out for the traps and surveillance set by the Neighbor in response to your movements",
    "Explore the spooky basement to uncover chilling secrets",
    "Use clever tactics and strategy to outwit the Neighbor's intelligent AI",
    "Experiment with various methods and learn from your failures"
